---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Chematch study
description: "Study chemistry reactions with click-to-reveal spoilers."
permalink: /chematch/study/index.html
extraCSS:
  - /static/css/chematch.css
  - /static/css/nav.css
  - /static/css/footer.css
---
  <main class="chematch-page">
<section class="study" id="study">
  <p class="cm-lead">Pick what to hide. Click a hidden box to reveal it, click again to hide it.</p>

  <p class="cm-label">Hide</p>
  <div class="cm-pills" data-group="mode">
    <button type="button" class="cm-btn cm-opt is-active" data-value="all">Nothing (show all)</button>
    <button type="button" class="cm-btn cm-opt" data-value="reactants">Reactants</button>
    <button type="button" class="cm-btn cm-opt" data-value="products">Products</button>
    <button type="button" class="cm-btn cm-opt" data-value="conditions">Conditions</button>
  </div>
  <div class="cm-pills cm-actions">
    <button type="button" class="cm-btn" data-action="shuffle">Shuffle</button>
    <button type="button" class="cm-btn" data-action="reset">Reset order</button>
     <a class="cm-btn" href="/chematch/">Play the game</a>
   </div>

  <div id="st-list" class="st-list"></div>
</section>
  </main>


<script type="application/json" id="chematch-data">{{ chematch | dump | safe }}</script>
<script src="/static/js/study.js" defer></script>
